        "products"
      ],
      "initialCode": "",
      "options": [],
      "acceptedBlanks": [],
      "expectedOutput": {
        "kind": "query",
        "columns": [
          "price"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            15
          ],
          [
            35
          ],
          [
            45
          ],
          [
            65
          ],
          [
            89
          ]
        ],
        "rowCount": 5
      },
      "referenceSolutions": [
        {
          "kind": "reference",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT DISTINCT price FROM products ORDER BY price",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT DISTINCT price FROM products ORDER BY price"
        },
        {
          "kind": "代数或函数等价",
          "mysqlSql": "SELECT price FROM products GROUP BY price ORDER BY price",
          "sqliteSql": "SELECT price FROM products GROUP BY price ORDER BY price",
          "explanation": "用仅含投影字段的 GROUP BY 对结果去重。"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        "明确结果需要哪些输入字段，以及是否保留原始行的重复。",
        "结合《DISTINCT 去重》：DISTINCT 对整个输出元组去重，不是仅针对紧随其后的一个字段。",
        "关注这个局部结构（空缺部分仍需自行完成）：\nSELECT □□□price FROM products ORDER BY price"
      ],
      "explanation": "相同售价的多种商品只形成一个价格档位。\n执行思路：确认products的输入记录；仅在题设指定的范围内去重；输出price列；遵循题设排序和并列规则。\n公开夹具实际返回 5 行、1 列；完整结果见 expectedOutput。\n另一种可用写法：用仅含投影字段的 GROUP BY 对结果去重。",
